<title>GUYANA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>GUYANA GOVERNMENT LIST (961011)</p>
<p>  President (Sworn in 9 Oct 1992).................Cheddi JAGAN</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT (Formed 13 October 1992)</p>
<p>  Prime Minister.....................................Sam HINDS</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Mining)</p>
<p>SENIOR MINISTERS:</p>
<p>  Agriculture..............................Reepu Daman PERSAUD</p>
<p>  Education...................................Dr Dale BISNAUTH</p>
<p>  Finance (Acting)..............................Bharrat JAGDEO</p>
